   "notes": "Standard third-order Birch-Murnaghan pressure-volume EOS in the Eulerian finite-strain convention. V0, K0, and K0_prime were all fitted; none was fixed. V0 is one conventional orthorhombic Pbnm cell containing four CaTiO3 formula units. The paper reports no parameter covariance and does not state a confidence convention for the printed coefficient errors. The ambient pressure row has no printed pressure uncertainty; no zero uncertainty is invented in the dataset."
